 <br/> <span class=\"bullet italic\">What do the characters learn at the end of the legend? For example: Does the legend explain the origins of certain animals (seals, walruses) , land formations like mountains or why people behave a certain way?\n</span> <br/> <span class=\"bullet italic\">Use linking words to connect ideas.\n</span> <br/> <span class=\"bullet italic\">Describe people and places using a wide range of vocabulary.\n</span> <br/> </br>"}, {"type": "text", "content": "When you have typed in ALL your answers, click the <span class  = \"strong\">Go to Writing Task</span> button. \n</span>\n\n"}, {"type": "text", "content": "<br/>My Narrative"}]}, {"type": "group", "contents": [{"type": "group_name", "content": "Activity 3"}]}, {"type": "feedback", "content": {"allowed_attempts": 2, "correct_feedback": "Correct!", "attempt_feedback": [{"type": "text", "content": ""}, {"type": "text", "content": ""}], "incorrect_feedback": [{"type": "text", "content": "Whoops! Something important is missing."}, {"type": "text", "content": "Maybe next time..."}]}}, {"type": "instructions", "contents": [{"type": "text", "content": "<span class=\"strong\">Time to review your narrative.\n</span>"}, {"type": "text", "content": "Did you include the following in your narrative?\n"}, {"type": "text", "content": "<ul> <li>Characters, time period, setting and plot?\n</li>\n<li>Linking words to connect ideas.\n</li>\n <li>A wide range of vocabulary related to the topic.\n</li>\n </ul>"}, {"type": "text", "content": "Read the short narrative to a partner. \n"}, {"type": "text", "content": "Proofread your narrative for grammar, spelling and punctuation errors.\n"}, {"type": "text", "content": "Click the <span class=\"strong\">Submit </span>button to save your work.\n"}]}, {"grading_contents": {"header": {"rows": [{"cells": [{"content_type": "text", "colspan": 1, "element": "th", "content": ""}, {"content_type": "text", "colspan": 5, "element": "th", "content": ""}]}, {"cells": [{"conte